二首 其二","author":"曾协","text":"点数诗流一唯阿，胸中星斗想森罗。\n新篇莫浪传红粉，堪与朱弦荐咏歌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78359,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和剡宰二首 其一","author":"曾协","text":"绿阴匼匝欲周阿，正午庭空雀可罗。\n更许瘦筇支病骨，玉山影里听弦歌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78360,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和翁士秀瑞香水仙二首 其二","author":"曾协","text":"正白深黄态自浓，不将红粉作华容。\n却疑洛浦波心见，合向瑶台月下逢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78361,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和翁士秀瑞香水仙二首 其一","author":"曾协","text":"蝶绕蜂团碧玉丛，紫罗囊小透香风。\n自从鼻观销烦恼，疑在维摩丈室中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78362,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和韩子文五首 其五","author":"曾协","text":"寒浅定知春已至，意闲仍觉日初长。\n已谙荣谢如空幻，一室萧然且坐忘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78363,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和韩子文五首 其四","author":"曾协","text":"谁人解遣醉时醒，始变鸣禽第一声。\n似向幽人催蜡屐，水边沙际看春生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":78364,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和韩子文五首 其三","author":"曾协","text":"与君联辔听冬珑，下马荀陈列座中。\n南北